    "Both are hidden by default, as in the original MacDown. With the status bar hidden, the encoding can still be changed in File ▸ Encoding; with the divider hidden you can still drag the boundary between the two panes to resize them." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认都隐藏,与原版 MacDown 一致。隐藏状态栏后,编码可在 文件 ▸ 编码 中更改;分隔线隐藏时仍可在两栏交界处拖动调整宽度。"
